    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "This clinic...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, haven't we been here before?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But why has it... become like this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been totally abandoned... It looks it was attacked by Reunion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wasn't this Azazel, the clinic for the Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though they had access to Chernobog's entire underground intelligence network, they still refused to work with us...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "Back then, it wasn't clear what kind of dealings that had with Reunion...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "If only they had given us some information, or even just a hint...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "We could've been out of here by now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "They brought this outcome upon themselves!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not the entire story...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, you were there for the negotiations, weren't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "That cold and arrogant attitude of theirs really ticked me off...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't blame them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "Boss...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
